This project analyzes five years of historical data from Gold, a fictional e-commerce company specializing in outdoor and adventure gear. Using SQL, I created detailed customer, product, and time-based performance reports to uncover trends in sales, customer behavior, and product growth. The SQL file contains all query logic used to clean, transform, and analyze the data. Excel was used to build charts and visual summaries, and a separate Word document captures key insights and findings. This repository showcases an end-to-end analytics workflow to support Gold’s strategic planning and upcoming international expansion.
